{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_github_github", "label": "Doctrina de GitHub con `gh`", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": "L1-L59", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_github_three_commandments", "label": "Los tres mandamientos de `gh`", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Identidad del usuario siempre (fork+PR si faltan permisos, nunca bots ni tokens de m\u00e1quina), JSON filtrado nunca output crudo, y estado real del servidor antes de actuar."}, {"id": "docs_github_token_economy", "label": "JSON filtrado en vez de output crudo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El output humano de gh es bonito y car\u00edsimo en tokens; --json con -q da exactamente los 5 campos que importan."}, {"id": "docs_github_stacked_prs", "label": "Stacked PRs con git puro", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cadena main\u2190p1\u2190p2\u2190p3 para que cada PR muestre solo su diff incremental; `git rebase --update-refs` mueve toda la cadena de una vez y el aterrizaje va de abajo arriba retargeteando."}, {"id": "docs_github_safe_merge_three_lights", "label": "Tres luces en verde para mergear", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Checks, reviews y ausencia de conflictos; un check rojo 'que no parece relacionado' se investiga, no se ignora, y --admin solo con orden expl\u00edcita del usuario."}, {"id": "docs_github_force_with_lease", "label": "`--force-with-lease` siempre", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aborta si alguien m\u00e1s push\u00f3; `--force` a secas jam\u00e1s."}, {"id": "docs_github_small_prs", "label": "PRs peque\u00f1os y de una idea", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Menos de 400 l\u00edneas se revisa en minutos y m\u00e1s de 1000 se aprueba sin leer, que es peor; el body dice c\u00f3mo se prob\u00f3 de verdad, con comandos y resultados observados."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_github_github", "target": "docs_github_three_commandments", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_github_github", "target": "docs_github_token_economy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_github_github", "target": "docs_github_stacked_prs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_github_github", "target": "docs_github_safe_merge_three_lights", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_github_github", "target": "docs_github_force_with_lease", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GITHUB.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_github_github", "target": "docs_github_small_prs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score":